lative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#checkpoint-before-risky-operations" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">Checkpoint before risky operations</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#multiple-restore-points" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">Multiple restore points</a></li></ul></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a style="--toc-padding-left:0rem" href="#try-it-out" class="break-words py-1 block pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 font-medium dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">Try it out</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a style="--toc-padding-left:0rem" href="#limitations" class="break-words py-1 block pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 font-medium dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">Limitations</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a style="--toc-padding-left:0rem" href="#troubleshooting" class="break-words py-1 block pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 font-medium dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">Troubleshooting</a><ul class=""><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#checkpointing-options-not-recognized" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">Checkpointing options not recognized</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#user-messages-don%E2%80%99t-have-uuids" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">User messages don’t have UUIDs</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#%E2%80%9Dno-file-checkpoint-found-for-this-message%E2%80%9D-error" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">”No file checkpoint found for this message” error</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#%E2%80%9Dfile-rewinding-is-not-enabled%E2%80%9D-error" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">”File rewinding is not enabled” error</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="1"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#%E2%80%9Dprocesstransport-is-not-ready-for-writing%E2%80%9D-error" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">”ProcessTransport is not ready for writing” error</a></li></ul></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a style="--toc-padding-left:0rem" href="#next-steps" class="break-words py-1 block pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 font-medium dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">Next steps</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative grow box-border flex-col w-full mx-auto px-1 lg:pl-[5.7rem] lg:-ml-12 xl:w-[calc(100%-28rem)] lg:max-w-[calc(var(--content-width,100vw)+5.95rem)]" data-empty-page-layout="" id="content-area"><header id="header" class="relative leading-none @container/page-header"><div class="mt-0.5 space-y-2.5"><div class="eyebrow h-5 text-primary dark:text-primary-light text-sm font-semibold">Control and observability</div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center relative gap-2 min-w-0"><h1 id="page-title" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-gray-900 tracking-tight dark:text-gray-200 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] font-semibold">Rewind file changes with checkpointing</h1><div id="page-context-menu" class="items-center shrink-0 min-w-[156px] justify-end ml-auto hidden @[520px]/page-header:flex"><button id="page-context-menu-button" class="rounded-l-xl px-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 py-1.5 border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/[0.07] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark hover:bg-gray-600/5 dark:hover:bg-gray-200/5 border-r-0" aria-label="Copy page"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-center font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M14.25 5.25H7.25C6.14543 5.25 5.25 6.14543 5.25 7.25V14.25C5.25 15.3546 6.14543 16.25 7.25 16.25H14.25C15.3546 16.25 16.25 15.3546 16.25 14.25V7.25C16.25 6.14543 15.3546 5.25 14.25 5.25Z" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2.80103 11.998L1.77203 5.07397C1.61003 3.98097 2.36403 2.96397 3.45603 2.80197L10.38 1.77297C11.313 1.63397 12.19 2.16297 12.528 3.00097" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="grid"><span aria-hidden="true" class="invisible col-start-1 row-start-1">Copy page</span><span class="col-start-1 row-start-1">Copy page</span></span></div></button><button type="button" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_6rh3b9qnpfb39p7b9snpfiutb_" aria-label="More actions" class="group disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;span]:line-clamp-1 overflow-hidden group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:focus-visible:outline-primary-light py-0.5 gap-1 text-sm text-gray-950/50 dark:text-white/50 group-hover:text-gray-950/70 dark:group-hover:text-white/70 rounded-none rounded-r-xl border flex items-center justify-center h-[34px] border-gray-200 aspect-square dark:border-white/[0.07] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark hover:bg-gray-600/5 dark:hover:bg-gray-200/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="size-3 transition-transform text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-600 dark:group-hover:text-gray-400 shrink-0 rotate-90"><path d="M6.5 2.75L12.75 9L6.5 15.25" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="mt-2 text-lg prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert [&amp;&gt;*]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><p>Track file changes during agent sessions and restore files to any previous state</p></div><div id="page-context-menu" class="flex items-center shrink-0 min-w-[156px] mt-3 @[520px]/page-header:hidden"><button id="page-context-menu-button" class="rounded-l-xl px-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 py-1.5 border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/[0.07] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark hover:bg-gray-600/5 dark:hover:bg-gray-200/5 border-r-0" aria-label="Copy page"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-center font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M14.25 5.25H7.25C6.14543 5.25 5.25 6.14543 5.25 7.25V14.25C5.25 15.3546 6.14543 16.25 7.25 16.25H14.25C15.3546 16.25 16.25 15.3546 16.25 14.25V7.25C16.25 6.14543 15.3546 5.25 14.25 5.25Z" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2.80103 11.998L1.77203 5.07397C1.61003 3.98097 2.36403 2.96397 3.45603 2.80197L10.38 1.77297C11.313 1.63397 12.19 2.16297 12.528 3.00097" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="grid"><span aria-hidden="true" class="invisible col-start-1 row-start-1">Copy page</span><span class="col-start-1 row-start-1">Copy page</span></span></div></button><button type="button" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_dj3b9qnpfb39p7b9snpfiutb_" aria-label="More actions" class="group disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;span]:line-clamp-1 overflow-hidden group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:focus-visible:outline-primary-light py-0.5 gap-1 text-sm text-gray-950/50 dark:text-white/50 group-hover:text-gray-950/70 dark:group-hover:text-white/70 rounded-none rounded-r-xl border flex items-center justify-center h-[34px] border-gray-200 aspect-square dark:border-white/[0.07] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark hover:bg-gray-600/5 dark:hover:bg-gray-200/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="size-3 transition-transform text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-600 dark:group-hover:text-gray-400 shrink-0 rotate-90"><path d="M6.5 2.75L12.75 9L6.5 15.25" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="mdx-content @container/columns-container relative mt-8 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert [contain:inline-size] isolate empty:hidden mb-14" data-page-title="Rewind file changes with checkpointing" data-page-href="/en/agent-sdk/file-checkpointing" id="content"><span data-as="p">File checkpointing tracks file modifications made through the <a class="link" href="/docs/en/tools-reference#write-tool-behavior">Write</a>, <a class="link" href="/docs/en/tools-reference#edit-tool-behavior">Edit</a>, and <a class="link" href="/docs/en/tools-reference#notebookedit-tool-behavior">NotebookEdit</a> tools during an agent session, allowing you to rewind files to any previous state. To watch a rewind restore a file, jump to the <a href="#try-it-out" class="link">interactive example</a>.</span>
<div role="note" aria-label="Warning" class="callout my-4 px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl flex gap-3 border border-yellow-200 bg-yellow-50 dark:border-yellow-900 dark:bg-yellow-600/20 [&amp;_[data-component-part=&#x27;callout-icon&#x27;]]:mt-px" data-callout-type="warning"><div class="mt-0.5 w-4" data-component-part="callout-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="flex-none size-5 text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-300"><path d="M 9 6.75 v 1.5 m 0 3 h 0.0075 m -5.2035 3 h 10.392 c 1.155 0 1.8765 -1.2503 1.299 -2.25 L 10.299 3 c -0.5775 -0.9997 -2.0205 -0.9997 -2.598 0 L 2.505 12 c -0.5775 0.9997 0.144 2.25 1.299 2.25 z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="text-sm prose dark:prose-invert min-w-0 w-full [&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-light dark:[&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-dark [&amp;_code]:text-current! [&amp;_kbd]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:border-current [&amp;_strong]:text-current! text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-300" data-component-part="callout-content"><span data-as="p">Only changes made through the Write, Edit, and NotebookEdit tools are tracked. Changes made through Bash commands (like <code>echo &gt; file.txt</code> or <code>sed -i</code>) are not captured by the checkpoint system, and neither are edits a <a class="link" href="/docs/en/agent-sdk/subagents">subagent</a> applies, except a <a class="link" href="/docs/en/skills#run-skills-in-a-subagent">skill with <code>context: fork</code></a> that runs in the foreground.</span></div></div>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="how-checkpointing-works"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#how-checkpointing-works" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">How checkpointing works</span></h2>
<span data-as="p">When you enable file checkpointing, the SDK creates backups of files before modifying them through the Write, Edit, or NotebookEdit tools. User messages in the response stream include a checkpoint UUID that you can use as a restore point.</span>
<div role="note" aria-label="Note" class="callout my-4 px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl flex gap-3 border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 dark:border-blue-900 dark:bg-blue-600/20" data-callout-type="note"><div class="mt-0.5 w-4" data-component-part="callout-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300"><path d="M 9 1.6714 C 13.0371 1.6714 16.3286 4.9629 16.3286 9 C 16.3286 13.0371 13.0371 16.3286 9 16.3286 C 7.0574 16.3252 5.1953 15.552 3.8217 14.1783 C 2.448 12.8047 1.6748 10.9426 1.6714 9 C 1.6714 4.9629 4.9629 1.6714 9 1.6714 Z M 9 0 C 4.0371 0 0 4.0371 0 9 C 0 13.9629 4.0371 18 9 18 C 13.9629 18 18 13.9629 18 9 C 18 4.0371 13.9629 0 9 0 Z M 10.2857 3.8571 H 7.7143 V 10.2857 H 10.2857 V 3.8571 Z M 10.2857 11.5714 H 7.7143 V 14.1429 H 10.2857 V 11.5714 Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div class="text-sm prose dark:prose-invert min-w-0 w-full [&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-light dark:[&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-dark [&amp;_code]:text-current! [&amp;_kbd]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:border-current [&amp;_strong]:text-current! text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300" data-component-part="callout-content"><span data-as="p">File rewinding restores files on disk to a previous state. It does not rewind the conversation itself. The conversation history and context remain intact after calling <code>rewindFiles()</code> (TypeScript) or <code>rewind_files()</code> (Python).</span></div></div>
<span data-as="p">When you rewind to a checkpoint, Claude Code deletes the files it created and restores the files it modified to their content at that point. Claude Code skips a tracked path that is a symlink, hard link, or other non-regular file. It also skips a tracked file whose parent directory no longer resolves to its checkpoint-time location, or whose backup it can’t read safely. <a class="link" href="/docs/en/agent-sdk/typescript#rewindfilesresult"><code>RewindFilesResult</code></a> counts every skipped path in its <code>skippedLinks</code> field. Skipping requires Claude Code v2.1.216 or later; before v2.1.216, a rewind wrote and deleted through links at tracked paths.</span>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="implement-checkpointing"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#implement-checkpointing" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Implement checkpointing</span></h2>
<span data-as="p">To use file checkpointing, enable it in your options, capture checkpoint UUIDs from the response stream, then call <code>rewindFiles()</code> (TypeScript) or <code>rewind_files()</code> (Python) when you need to restore.</span>
<span data-as="p">The examples in this section use the prompt “Refactor the authentication module”. Run them in a project that contains an authentication module, or change the prompt to name files that exist in your project, so you can watch files change and see the rewind restore them.</span>
<span data-as="p">This example enables checkpointing, captures the checkpoint UUID and session ID from the response stream, then resumes the session later to rewind files. The example’s numbered comments match the steps that follow.</span>
